owed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"虽然这辆车也配有车篷，但搭起来很费时间，\n等弄好时早已浑身湿透。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-363","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-363"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"正漫不经心地想着这些，拐过十字路口时……","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-3b6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-3b6"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"某个公交站。\n我发现了熟悉的面孔，便把车停下。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-4a0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-4a0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「哟，明。好久不见」","speaker":"优花"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-52d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-52d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「咦……是优花啊……」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-58c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-58c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「你怎么会在这种地方？」","speaker":"优花"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-5f3","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-5f3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「这也不是什么了不起的事……」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-658","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-658"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「嘛，虽然不太清楚，不过你要是在等公交，我送你一程吧」","speaker":"优花"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-6dd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-6dd"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「不用。我本来就不是来等公交的」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-74d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-74d"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"明一边回答，一边把手中塑料瓶里的水倒在路面上。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-7a0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-7a0"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"不，准确地说，她似乎是在给长在那里的一株植物浇水。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-83c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-83c"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……那是什么花？\n即使从这样的沥青缝里钻出来，也依然长着翠绿的叶子。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-8e6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-8e6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「你也开始对花感兴趣了？」","speaker":"优花"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-957","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-957"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「算是吧……稍微有一点」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-9b0","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-9b0"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「哦，真不像你。\n居然会喜欢这种杂草似的东西」","speaker":"优花"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-a46","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-a46"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「是啊。很不像我吧……」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-ad9","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-ad9"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「优花，我还有点事，能稍微等我一下吗？」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-b56","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-b56"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「呃，啊，嗯？」","speaker":"优花"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-baf","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-baf"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「啊，对了，阵雨快来了，小心点」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-c1b","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c1b"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"说完，明朝公交站走去。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-c5e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-c5e"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"与此同时，一名女孩从对面向这边走来。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-caf","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-caf"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"……是谁？\n我不觉得明会有什么交谈对象。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-d09","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-d09"},"allowed":["text"],"speakerReason":"no-native-speaker","baseline":{"text":"我知道她没有朋友。\n不，她曾经有过朋友——不过那应该已经是过去式了。","speaker":"旁白"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-dd5","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-dd5"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「又见面了呢」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-e2e","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e2e"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「咦，啊……我记得你是……」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-e96","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-e96"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「我是明。好久不见」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-ef6","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-ef6"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「咦，啊，好的……」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-f51","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-f51"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「总之，阵雨马上又要来了，先过来这边」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-1027","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1027"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「咦，哇，真的，雨下得好大」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-10bd","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-10bd"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「怎么样？稍微适应学校了吗？」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-1174","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1174"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「啊，呃，那个……」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-11d3","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-11d3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「看你这样子，好像还是老样子呢」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-1242","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1242"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……嗯」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-1295","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1295"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「这样啊。那也是没办法的事呢」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-132c","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-132c"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「你有发过火吗？」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-138d","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-138d"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「大概……没有吧……」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-13ee","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-13ee"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「那么……任性过吗？」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-144f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-144f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……不知道……」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-14aa","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-14aa"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「原来如此……那就简单了」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-150f","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-150f"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「偶尔发发火也好。任性一点也好」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-1586","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1586"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「那样的话，就不会再孤单一人了吗？」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-15f3","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-15f3"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「大概，总有一天会吧……因为你还有时间」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-16ad","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-16ad"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「啊，你的公交来了，再不赶快上车就来不及了」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-1720","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1720"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「啊，好的……呃，那个……」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-1787","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1787"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「明小姐为什么……要对我这么好？」","speaker":"堇"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-1804","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1804"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「只是偶然。仅此而已。再见」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-18a4","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-18a4"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「喂，刚才那个孩子是怎么回事？」","speaker":"优花"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-1934","target":{"variantId":"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep","sectionId":"main","eventId":"mjo-1934"},"allowed":["text","speaker"],"speakerReason":"separate-native-message","baseline":{"text":"「……只是认识的人。\n一个孤零零的、准家里蹲」","speaker":"明"}},{"key":"[\"mjo/curated-zh-cn/narcissu-sumire/ep\",\"main\"]/mjo-19c6","target":{"variantId":"mj